00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:36.843
of Russian war crimes.

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:37.844
In December,

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:39.178
I supported an effort

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:42.148
to authorize the administration to share

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:44.484
