00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:47.420
They have not yet done that.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.921
So I just today

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:49.689
actually released

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:51.324
a bipartisan letter that I led

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:52.692
with over 20 of my colleagues,

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.093
Republicans and Democrats,

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.395
that encouraged the administration

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.863
to use that authority,

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:58.965
because perpetrators of these crimes

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.400
must be held accountable.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.834
Starting with Vladimir Putin, he's

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:02.235
already been

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.037
indicted by the ICC, actually,

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:06.005
for targeting a civilian infrastructure.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.173
But every other rank

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:07.607
and file

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:08.775
member of the Russian military

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:10.910
that is engaged in these crimes,

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:14.213
you know, moving forward requires

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:15.315
accountable ability

00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:16.749
for those who have committed crimes

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:17.884
throughout all of history.

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:19.218
You can't move forward

00:05:19.218 --> 00:05:20.620
and you can't remedy these things

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.988
without accountability.

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:22.689
Congressman Crowley,

00:05:22.689 --> 00:05:24.457
